Trademarks

Google Chat and Google are trademarks of Google LLC. spacebar is an independent
third-party client. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by
Google, and Google does not support it.

The name appears here only to say what this tool talks to, which is descriptive
use. No Google mark is in the name of this project, its module path, its
repository, or its binary, and none should be added to a fork's. The product
name is deliberately a word with no mark in it; if it is ever changed, it must
be changed to another one, and the change is a change to internal/meta.AppName
and to nothing else.

